target: internal/gather/gather.go
verify: go test ./internal/gather/ -count=1 -run 'TestAGoModuleIsDetected'
expect: --- FAIL: TestAGoModuleIsDetected/go.mod_alone
why:    lint_fix false tells Step 4a that the Go lint command only reports, though go fmt rewrites files; the loop would not stage what it changed.
--- old
		lint, fix = "go fmt ./... && go vet ./...", true
--- new
		lint, fix = "go fmt ./... && go vet ./...", false
